WEBVTT

00:06:59.939 --> 00:07:02.069
than people who don't give
money to charity.

00:07:02.093 --> 00:07:04.707
I know you're looking
at the red country in the middle.

00:07:04.731 --> 00:07:06.885
I would be a jerk and not
tell you what it is,

00:07:06.909 --> 00:07:08.544
but it's Central African Republic.

00:07:08.568 --> 00:07:09.720
You can make up stories.

00:07:09.744 --> 00:07:11.756
Maybe it's different there
for some reason.

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.994
Just below that to the right
is Rwanda, though,

00:07:14.018 --> 00:07:15.232
which is amazingly green.

00:07:15.256 --> 00:07:16.642
So almost everywhere we look,

00:07:16.666 --> 00:07:19.099
we see that giving money away
makes you happier

00:07:19.123 --> 00:07:20.669
than keeping it for yourself.

00:07:20.693 --> 00:07:23.658
What about work, which is where
we spend the rest of our time,

00:07:23.682 --> 00:07:25.544
when we're not with the people we know.

00:07:25.568 --> 00:07:28.791
We decided to infiltrate some companies
and do a very similar thing.

00:07:28.815 --> 00:07:30.620
These are sales teams in Belgium.